        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine telemetry displays unavailable readings safely when disk, network, Thunderbolt, or volume counters overflow integer conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pairing keeps the selected Mac open when its unpaired entry becomes a trusted peer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pairing instructions explain that trust is saved separately on each Mac.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The protected updater installer creates a missing PrivilegedHelperTools directory on a fresh Mac, validating its parent and preserving existing shared-directory permissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Mac in the machine sidebar saves an unpaired SSH target and opens fingerprint verification, enabling reciprocal pairing through the window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
